From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Dylan Ironside <dylan@dylanironside.io>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 07:55:10 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: soc: apple: apple,t6041-aop: Add the
 T8132 ALS and LAS services

The T8132 AOP already uses this binding (c88ffc6870), but its als and las
children only admit the T6041 compatibles. On the J604 (MacBook Pro 14-inch,
M4) the AOP firmware announces both services: the AOP core registers
als.N.auto and las.N.auto platform devices for them, and they stay unbound
because no device tree node matches.

Allow apple,t8132-aop-als and apple,t8132-aop-las in front of the generic
compatibles the drivers match on.

Signed-off-by: Dylan Ironside <dylan@dylanironside.io>
Assisted-by: Claude:claude-opus-5.5
(cherry picked from commit 6eea0a12211e4f1ca9f5ab7ed902719d9b17d6b1)
---
 .../devicetree/bindings/soc/apple/apple,t6041-aop.yaml    | 8 ++++++--
 1 file changed, 6 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/soc/apple/apple,t6041-aop.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/soc/apple/apple,t6041-aop.yaml
index cdb3bb926b..6b57b39dac 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/soc/apple/apple,t6041-aop.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/soc/apple/apple,t6041-aop.yaml
@@ -75,7 +75,9 @@ properties:
     properties:
       compatible:
         items:
-          - const: apple,t6041-aop-als
+          - enum:
+              - apple,t6041-aop-als
+              - apple,t8132-aop-als
           - const: apple,aop-als
 
     required:
@@ -89,7 +91,9 @@ properties:
     properties:
       compatible:
         items:
-          - const: apple,t6041-aop-las
+          - enum:
+              - apple,t6041-aop-las
+              - apple,t8132-aop-las
           - const: apple,aop-las
 
     required:
